{"results":[{"url":"https://jaswanti-jewel.in","title":"Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Logo","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West  Banner](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1783233343.jpg)\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West  Banner](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1783233330.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![P51800048817](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/Jaswanti-Jewel-QR-P51800048817_-05072026070237.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. P51800048817\n\n[![P51800048817](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/Jaswanti-Jewel-QR-P51800048817_-05072026070237.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West  Banner](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1783233343.jpg)\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West  Banner](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1783233330.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Ashray Group Developer](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nAshray Group\n\n![Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, Kandivali West Location](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Road, Kandivali West\n\nLocation\n\n# About Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Project\n\n**Jaswanti Jewel Chhatrapati Shivaji Road** is a Project by **Ashray Group** situated in the most premium location of **Kandivali West**, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, offers **2, 3, 4 and 5 BHK** Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications. Ashray Group Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West is an Exclusive Tower of **G + 37** **Storey**.\n\nJaswanti Jewel Kandivali West offers 2 BHK apartments starting from 726 Sqft carpet area and 3 BHK apartments starting from 1006 Sqft carpet area. Jaswanti Jewel MahaRERA Number P51800048817.\n\nJaswanti Jewel Ashray Group Kandivali West Property Features **Amenities** like Arrival Lobby, Automated Car Parking, Global-styled Gym, Yoga Studio, Spa & Salon, Steam Room, AV Room, Multipurpose Court on Ground Level, Games’ Arena, Infinity Pool, Jacuzzi, Food Serving Area, Juice Serving Area, Zen Garden, Senior Citizen Area, Open-Air Theatre, E.V. Charging Points, 3-tier Security System, Fire Fighting Systems, Cafe with Waiting Lounge. Jaswanti Jewel Chhatrapati Shivaji Road Has **Excellent Connectivity** Lotus Multispeciality Hospital - 3 Mins, Oscar Hospital - 8 Mins, Namaha Healthcare - 10 Mins, Tunga Hospital - 10 Mins, Thakur International School - 3 Mins, Atharva College - 5 Mins, KES International School - 5 Mins, Billabong High International School - 7 Mins, Ryan International School - 7 Mins, Kapol Vidhyanidhi International School - 7 Mins, Witty International School - 8 Mins, Croma - 5 Mins, Infiniti Mall - 7 Mins, D Mart - 10 Mins, Raghuleela Mall - 12 Mins, Inorbit Mall - 12 Mins, Growel's 101 Mall - 15 Mins, Oberoi Mall - 15 Mins. Business Hubs - Mindspace - 10 Mins, Mindspace - 10 Mins.\n\nJaswanti Jewel **address** is Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, Off M G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai - 400067.\n\n**Ashray Group** has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Jaswanti Jewel, Jaswanti Bliss, Jaswanti Landmark, Jaswanti Gold, Jaswanti Garden, Jaswanti Woods, Jaswanti Allied Business Centre, Smruti, Raj Chambers, Dayal Smruti, Minarette\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West_ Elevation Image](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1783233218.jpg)\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nJaswanti Jewel\n\n![Location](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Road, Kandivali West\n\n![Developer Name](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nAshray Group\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 37 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\n2, 3, 4 and 5 BHK\n\n![AREA](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n726 – 1747 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| • Off M.G. road In A Premium Zone |\n| • Magnificent Arrival Lobby |\n| • Automated Car-parking Tower |\n| • G+37 Storey Single Tower |\n| • Club House & Sky-life Indulgences On 37th & 38th Floor |\n| • Access To The Project Through A Designated Landscaped Pathway |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| 2 BHK | 726 - 728 Sqft | Click for Price |\n|\n| 3 BHK | 1006 Sqft | Click for Price |\n|\n| 4 & 5 BHK | 1744 - 1747 Sqft | Click for Price |\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Floor Plan\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-726-Sqft](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-726-Sqft_1783234433.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-726-Sqft\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-728-Sqft](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-728-Sqft_1783234444.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-2-BHK-728-Sqft\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-3-BHK-1006-Sqft](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-3-BHK-1006-Sqft_1783234454.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-3-BHK-1006-Sqft\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-2-&-3-Bed-Residences](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-2-&-3-Bed-Residences_1783234466.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-2-&-3-Bed-Residences\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-4-Bed-Residences](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-4-Bed-Residences_1783234478.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-4-Bed-Residences\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-5-Bed-Residences](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-5-Bed-Residences_1783234490.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Floor-Plan-Premium-5-Bed-Residences\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View-05072026065715.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Eye-View\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Day](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Day-05072026065730.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Day\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Night](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Night-05072026065751.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Elevation-Image-Night\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Living-Room.jpg](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Living-Room.jpg-05072026065532.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Living-Room.jpg\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Kitchen](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Kitchen-05072026065553.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Kitchen\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Balcony](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Balcony-05072026065616.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Balcony\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Bedroom](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Bedroom-05072026065635.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Bedroom\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Washroom](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Washroom-05072026065655.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Gallery-Washroom\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Arrival-Poch](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Arrival-Poch-05072026112252.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Arrival-Poch\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-AV-Room](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-AV-Room-05072026112306.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-AV-Room\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Cafe](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Cafe-05072026112322.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Cafe\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Double-Height-Entrance-Lobby](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Double-Height-Entrance-Lobby-05072026112338.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Double-Height-Entrance-Lobby\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Fully-Equipped-Gym](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Fully-Equipped-Gym-05072026112353.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Fully-Equipped-Gym\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Gourmet-Serving-Area](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Gourmet-Serving-Area-05072026112410.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Gourmet-Serving-Area\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Landscape-Pathway](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Landscape-Pathway-05072026112442.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Landscape-Pathway\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lift-Lobby](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lift-Lobby-05072026112457.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lift-Lobby\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lobby-Exterior](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lobby-Exterior-05072026112510.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lobby-Exterior\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lounge](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lounge-05072026112523.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Lounge\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Main-Lobby](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Main-Lobby-05072026112540.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Main-Lobby\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Salon](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Salon-05072026112610.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Salon\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Sky-Cafe](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Sky-Cafe-05072026112625.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Sky-Cafe\n\n![Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Spa-Room](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Jaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Spa-Room-05072026112640.jpg)\n\nJaswanti-Jewel-Amenities-Spa-Room\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Arrival Lobby\n* Automated Car Parking\n* Global-styled Gym\n* Yoga Studio\n* Spa & Salon\n* Steam Room\n* AV Room\n* Multipurpose Court on Ground Level\n* Games’ Arena\n* Infinity Pool\n* Jacuzzi\n* Food Serving Area\n* Juice Serving Area\n* Zen Garden\n* Senior Citizen Area\n* Open-Air Theatre\n* E.V. Charging Points\n* 3-tier Security System\n* Fire Fighting Systems\n* Cafe with Waiting Lounge\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* Vitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms\n* Vitrified Tiles for Bathroom Flooring & Dado\n* Wash Basin Counters\n* Vitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform\n* Kitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/Developer-favicon_-05072026065931.png)\n\n## Ashray Group\n\n**Ashray Group** Incepted nearly two decades ago, we have constructed some of the most renowned landmarks in the suburbs of Mumbai. Our endeavour is to develop lands and redevelop slums and societies to broaden the perspective of the people towards better lifestyles. We operate on firmly rooted principles of accountability, professionalism, innovation and transparency. At Ashray Group, we see things differently. Where others see land and building, bricks and mortar, we see strategic assets that help build value for our clients. We go beyond their expectations and then develop housing, commercial and industrial solutions that enrich how people live and work. In other words, we bring the highest standards of construction and expertise to each and every project.\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Construction Status\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Location\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nJaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, Off M G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai - 400067\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West MahaRera\n\n[![P51800048817](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/Jaswanti-Jewel-QR-P51800048817_-05072026070237.png)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nP51800048817\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[What types of homes are available at Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road?](#collapse0)\n\nJaswanti Jewel offers 2, 3, 4 and 5 BHK homes ranging from Carpet 726 – 1747 Sqft.\n\n[What amenities are provided at Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road?](#collapse1)\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as  Arrival Lobby, Automated Car Parking, Global-styled Gym, Yoga Studio, Spa & Salon, Steam Room, AV Room, Multipurpose Court on Ground Level, Games’ Arena, Infinity Pool, Jacuzzi, Food Serving Area, Juice Serving Area, Zen Garden, Senior Citizen Area, Open-Air Theatre, E.V. Charging Points, 3-tier Security System, Fire Fighting Systems, Cafe with Waiting Lounge and more.\n\n[What is the location advantage of Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road?](#collapse2)\n\nLocated Nearby Lotus Multispeciality Hospital - 3 Mins, Oscar Hospital - 8 Mins, Namaha Healthcare - 10 Mins, Tunga Hospital - 10 Mins, Thakur International School - 3 Mins, Atharva College - 5 Mins, KES International School - 5 Mins, Billabong High International School - 7 Mins, Ryan International School - 7 Mins, Kapol Vidhyanidhi International School - 7 Mins, Witty International School - 8 Mins, Croma - 5 Mins, Infiniti Mall - 7 Mins, D Mart - 10 Mins, Raghuleela Mall - 12 Mins, Inorbit Mall - 12 Mins, Growel's 101 Mall - 15 Mins, Oberoi Mall - 15 Mins. Business Hubs - Mindspace - 10 Mins, Mindspace - 10 Mins, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\n[Is Jaswanti Jewel, Chhatrapati Shivaji Road, a RERA-registered project?](#collapse3)\n\nYes, Jaswanti Jewel is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number P51800048817.\n\n[![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West ](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Jaswanti Jewel Kandivali West ](https://jaswanti-jewel.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  The information provided on this website is intended exclusively for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).\n\nThis website is a digital promotional showcase managed by\n\n#### **Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited**,\n\nan independent, MahaRERA-registered real estate agent bearing\n\n#### **MahaRERA Real Estate Agent Registration No. A51700026634**.\n\nThe project showcased herein, **\"Jaswanti Jewel Project\"**, is a registered real estate project developed by Ashray Group, bearing **MahaRERA Project Registration Number: P51800048817**. All project-related particulars, including specifications, configurations, dynamic floor plans, and layout designs, are provided for consumer awareness and initial guidance.\n\nThe text, representations, layout diagrams, and computer-generated mockups or images used on this portal are artist impressions and are indicative only. The final terms, pricing structure, dynamic stock availability, and specific project timelines are subject to change as per the promoter/developer’s updates or market modifications. In strict alignment with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), all buyers are encouraged to independently verify all verified files, sanctioned building plans, and project progress statuses on the official MahaRERA website at <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in> under the registered project number before making any booking or financial commitment.\n\nDigipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited functions purely as an authorized sourcing/facilitating partner and shall not be held liable for any unilateral alterations made by the developer to the underlying layout or project construct.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/ashray-jaswanti-jewel-kandivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343135383035","title":"Ashray Jaswanti Jewel in Kandivali West, Mumbai: Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Reviews","raw_content":"![video of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel](https://img.youtube.com/vi_webp/nLeX0z78PmI/hqdefault.webp \"video of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel\")\n![image of Ashray Jaswanti Jewel](https://img.staticmb.c