ey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2027** as per RERA. Construction is currently **70%** complete as of August 5, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2026**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800048817**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/43215>\n\nYes, litigation details are disclosed as per RERA:  \n• SLUM TRIBUNAL  \n• GRC  \n• AGRR  \n• Bombay High Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• Bombay City Civil Court - Civil  \n• BOMBAY HIGH COURT CIVIL APPELLATE JURISDICTION - Civil  \n• BOMBAY HIGH COURT APPEATE JURISDICTION - Civil  \n• Bombay High Court - Civil  \n• AGPC - Civil  \n  \nReview all documents carefully before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800048817**.\n\nThis project offers **17+** amenities. Key external amenities include Mini Theatre, Open Air Cinema, Indoor games, Jacuzzi, and BBQ Lawn.  \n Internal specifications include Stainless Steel Sink and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Ashray Jaswanti Jewel, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **726 sq. ft.**  \n• **728 sq. ft.**  \n• **766 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Ashray Jaswanti Jewel, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1006 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Ashray Jaswanti Jewel starts from **₹2.35 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **726 sq. ft.** – ₹2.35 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **728 sq. ft.** – ₹2.72 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **766 sq. ft.** – ₹2.92 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Ashray Jaswanti Jewel starts from **₹3.80 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1006 sq. ft.** – ₹3.80 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.75 acres** with **1** towers with **G+37** floors. It is available in **2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **726** to **1006 sq. ft.**\n\nAshray Jaswanti Jewel provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Ashray Jaswanti Jewel project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Off M.G Rd, Bhagat Colony, Kandivali west, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• New Link Road - 500m**   \n**• Dahanukar Wadi Metro Station - 600m**   \n**• Kandivali Railway Station - 1.7km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹35.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Ashray Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **30 years** of experience and more than **9 completed projects** across **Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban**.\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Kandivali West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Ashray Group** - with 30 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK at ₹2.35 Cr to ₹3.80 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Dimple 73 East](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/dimple-73-east_1777805092541-896027359-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Dimple 73 East](/projects/dimple-73-east)\n\n₹ 2.77 Cr - 5.54 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Dimples Group](/builder/dimples-group)\n\n818- 3977sqft\n\nKandivali West\n\nReady\n\n2BHK\n\n818sqft\n\n₹2.77 Cr\n\n(2+2)BHK Jodi\n\n1636sqft\n\n₹5.54 Cr\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n836sqft\n\n-\n\n3.5BHKSold Out\n\n1462sqft\n\n-\n\n4BHKSold Out\n\n2437sqft\n\n-\n\n6BHKSold Out\n\n3977sqft\n\n-\n\n[Dimples Group](/builder/dimples-group)Developer\n\n![Dimple Westwood](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/dimple-westwood_1777812248268-212088023-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Dimple Westwood](/projects/dimple-westwood)\n\n₹ 1.00 Cr - 1.81 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Dimples Group](/builder/dimples-group)\n\n378- 643sqft\n\nKandivali West\n\nDec 2027\n\n1BHK\n\n378sqft\n\n₹1.00 Cr\n\n1BHK\n\n418