Advice on RERA, Builder Refunds, Area Mismatch, Stuck Projects & More - at No Cost!\n\n100% Free","images":[]},{"url":"https://jaswantijewel.in","title":"Jaswanti Jewel Offers Luxury Properties in Kandivali West.","raw_content":"## Enquire Now\n\nGet a callback from our experts\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel banner](assets/images/newBanner/web-1.webp)\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel banner]()\n\n [Previous](#carouselExampleControls)   [Next](#carouselExampleControls)\n\n## Enquire Now\n\nGet a callback from our experts\n\n## Enquire Now\n\nGet a callback from our experts\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Elevation]()\n\n# OVERVIEW\n\n---\n\n# Finely Crafted for You to Live Preciously\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![Elevation View Of Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\nWelcome to Jaswanti Jewel, a residence that blends luxury with modern living. Situated in the popular area of Kandivali West, this project by Ashray Group offers 2 bhk in Kandivali West & 3 bhk flat in Kandivali West, each featuring stunning views, premium finishes, and an unmatched lifestyle.\n\n[ENQUIRE NOW](#)\n\n## PROJECT HALLMARKS\n\n---\n\n# Finely Crafted for You to Live Preciously\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![Lobby At Jaswanti Jewel ]()\n\nExplore exceptional apartments at Jaswanti Jewel, offering 2 & 3 BHK flat for sale in Kandivali West. Crafted with premium quality and thoughtful design, these homes elevate your everyday living experience.\n\n![OFF M.G.ROAD IN A PREMIUM ZONE]()\n\nOFF M.G.ROAD IN A PREMIUM ZONE\n\n![G+37 STOREY SINGLE TOWER]()\n\nG+37 STOREY SINGLE TOWER\n\n![MAGNIFICENT ARRIVAL LOBBY]()\n\nMAGNIFICENT ARRIVAL LOBBY\n\n![CLUB HOUSE & SKY-LIFE INDULGENCES ON 37TH & 38TH FLOOR]()\n\nCLUB HOUSE & SKY-LIFE INDULGENCES ON 37TH & 38TH FLOOR\n\n![AUTOMATED CAR-PARKING TOWER]()\n\nAUTOMATED CAR-PARKING TOWER\n\n![ACCESS TO THE PROJECT THROUGH A DESIGNATED LANDSCAPED PATHWAY]()\n\nACCESS TO THE PROJECT THROUGH A DESIGNATED LANDSCAPED PATHWAY\n\n  \n  \n ENQUIRE NOW\n\n![]()\n\n## LIVE PRECIOUSLY AND SOAK INTO INFINITE SERENITY\n\n---\n\nInfinity pool with serene views\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n## Glimpse\n\n---\n\n# Experience Jaswanti Jewel in Motion\n\n  \n\nTake a closer look at the lifestyle, luxury, and layouts through our exclusive walkthrough videos — and see why Jaswanti Jewel stands out among Kandivali West new projects.\n\n![YouTube Shorts thumbnail]()\n\n![YouTube Shorts thumbnail]()\n\n![YouTube Shorts thumbnail]()\n\n![YouTube Shorts thumbnail]()\n\n## CONNECTIVITY\n\n---\n\n# A Precious Location of Connectivity, Conveniences & Comfort\n\nFind your ideal 2 BHK Kandivali West flats at Jaswanti Jewel and experience seamless connectivity, where everything you need is just moments away.\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity School]()\n\nBillabong High International School  \n07 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity School]()\n\nLotus Multispeciality Hospital   \n 03 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Business Park]()\n\nNirlon Business Park  \n 20 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Business Park]()\n\nDahanukarwadi Metro Station   \n 03 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Infinity Mall]()\n\nInfiniti Mall   \n 07 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Infinity Mall]()\n\nAirport   \n 30 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Croma]()\n\nCroma   \n 05 Mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Croma]()\n\nSV Road   \n 05 Mins\n\n## CONNECTIVITY\n\n---\n\n# A Precious Location of Connectivity, Conveniences & Comfort\n\nFind your ideal 2 BHK Kandivali West flats at Jaswanti Jewel and experience seamless connectivity, where everything you need is just moments away.\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity School]()\n\nBillabong High International School  \n7 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity School]()\n\nLotus Multispeciality Hospital   \n 3 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Business Park]()\n\nNirlon Business Park   \n 20 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Business Park]()\n\nMetro   \n 3 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Infinity Mall]()\n\nInfiniti Mall   \n 7 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Infinity Mall]()\n\nAirport   \n 30 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Croma]()\n\nCroma   \n 5 mins\n\n![Jaswanti Jewel Connectivity Croma]()\n\nSV Road   \n 5 mins\n\n## AMENITIES\n\n---\n\n# Live a Life of Unmatched Comfort at Jaswanti Jewel\n\nExperience unmatched comfort at Jaswanti Jewel with our comprehensive range of luxurious amenities. From a global-styled gym to a zen garden, Our 2 BHK for sale in Kandivali West are designed to enhance your living experience.\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![]()\n\n## A DOUBLE HEIGHT WELCOME THAT REFLECTS ELEGANCE\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n---\n\nMagnificent Arrival Lobby\n\n# GALLERY\n\n---\n\n# A Glimpse of the Jewel\n\nExperience the pinnacle of luxury and sophistication at Jaswanti Jewel, one of the finest properties in Kandivali West, where every detail is crafted to elevate your living experience to a whole new level of excellence.\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n![Infinity Pool With Serene View At Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n[Previous](#carouselExampleIndicators-gallery)   [Next](#carouselExampleIndicators-gallery)\n\n![3D video](assets/images/full-video-img.webp)\n\n## PROJECT CONFIGURATION\n\n---\n\n# Perfectly Configured Homes for a Perfect Life at Jaswanti Jewel\n\n  \n\nAt Jaswanti Jewel, experience the epitome of modern living with our premium 2, 3, 4 and 5 BHK flats, each designed with the perfect configuration to cater to your unique needs and preferences in the bustling neighborhood of Kandivali West.\n\n![Jaswanti-jewel-floor-plan]()\n\n# 2 BHK 728 C.A ₹2.52 Cr++\n\n![Jaswanti-jewel-floor-plan]()\n\n# 3 BHK 1006 C.A ₹3.24 cr++\n\n![Jaswanti-jewel-floor-plan]()\n\n# 4 BHK on request\n\n## Testimonials\n\n---\n\n## Compliance\n\n---\n\n01\n\n### Environmental Clearance\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/1_EC_31.03.2022.pdf)\n\n02\n\n### MPCB – Consent\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/8_Online_Submitted_Form_V_Paradise_2023-2024.pdf)\n\n03\n\n### Paper Advertisement for Environmental Clearance\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/7_Advetisement.pdf)\n\n04\n\n### Online Submitted Form – V\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/2_CTE_26.07.2022.pdf)\n\n05\n\n### Six Month Compliance Report October 2025 – March 2026\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/2_Paradise_Constructions_Company_SRA_Kandivali___June_2026 (1).pdf)\n\n06\n\n### SRA Kandivali Compliance Report December 2025\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/2_Paradise_Constructions_Company_SRA_Kandivali___December_2025.pdf)\n\n07\n\n### Online Submitted Form – V 2024–2025\n\n [Download PDF](assets/pdf/4_Online_Submitted_Paradise_Construction_Form_V_2024-2025.pdf)\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n![Elevation View Of Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n## Jaswanti Jewel FAQs\n\n---\n\n# Frequently Asked Questions About Jaswanti Jewel\n\nNavigating Your Path to the Perfect Home in Kandivali West, One Question at a Time\n\n![Elevation View Of Jaswanti Jewel]()\n\n  \n\n##\n\nJaswanti Jewel offers a diverse range of residences to fit different needs and lifestyles. You can choose from finely crafted 2 BHK flat in Kandivali West, spacious 3 BHK flat in Kandivali West, or luxurious 4 BHK flat in Kandivali West. Each unit is designed to offer a high-quality living environment.\n\n##\n\nA: Jaswanti Jewel offers a wealth of leisure amenities designed to enhance holistic well-being for all residents, regardless of whether they occupy a 2 BHK, 3 BHK, or 4 BHK flat in Kandivali West. These amenities include an Infinity Pool, recreational areas, and various lifestyle facilities.\n\n##\n\nA: Jaswanti Jewel is a reputable real estate project registered under MahaRERA Registration No: P51800048817. It is a project by Ashray Group, a renowned developer known for creating architectural masterpieces and new-age lifestyle offerings across Mumbai. Whether you're interested in a 2 BHK, 3 BHK, or 4 BHK flat in Kandivali West, Jaswanti Jewel promises quality and excellence in every aspect of your living experience.\n\n## INVITING ENTRANCE PATHWAY\n\n---\n\nStep into a world of luxury at Jaswanti Jewel and make this exquisite residence your own today!\n\nArtist's Impression\n\n## Contact us\n\n---\n\nReach Out to Unlock Investment Opportunities with Jaswanti Jewel\n\n![email icon]()\n\nEmail\n\nsales@ashraygroup.com\n\n![phone icon]()\n\nPhone\n\n[+91-8767608888](tel:+918767608888)\n\n![office location icon]()\n\nOffice\n\nCTS No. 1327A, Chhatrapati Shivaji Rd, Off M. G. Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai - 400067\n\n### ABOUT ASHRAY\n\n---\n\nWe Mean What We Say, We Build What We Mean. No Ceiling On Excellence\n\n# MahaRERA Registration No: P51800048817\n\nThe last decade and a half has witnessed a peaking transformation in the progress of Mumbai's real estate. There has been a prominence of innovation that is reflected through deluxe and holistic landmarks at renowned addresses. Ashray Group has successfully established architectural masterpieces offering new-age lifestyles to many across Mumbai. Ashray Group has made steady progress through delivering 17 lakh sq. ft. to 1603 happy families.   \nWe, at Ashray Group are proud to be associated with a number of prominent MNCs.\n\n![Ashray Group Projects](https://jaswantijewel.in/assets/images/skyline.webp \"Projects by Ashray Group\")\n\n[CALL NOW](tel:+918767608888)  ENQUIRE NOW","images":[]}],"failed_results":[{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/ashray-jaswanti-jewel-kandivali-west-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r404129","error":"Failed to fetch url"}],"response_time":0.28,"request_id":"4213f69d-9354-4b43-9e69-39824c3f9915"}